	 (50,2,1,'In a large bowl, mix the minced meat with the flour, all spices, garlic, egg and the dissolved MAGGIآ® Chicken Bouillon cubes until a well-combined mixture forms. Divide the mixture into small equal size balls','foods/dissolvedkebab.jpg','Dissolved Kebab'),
	 (60,2,2,'In a large skillet, cook beef and garlic over medium heat 6-8 minutes or until beef is no longer pink, breaking up beef into crumbles. Meanwhile, in a small bowl, mix brown sugar, soy sauce, oil and seasonings.','foods/ricewithmeat.jpg','Rice with Meat'),
