	 (30,2,7,'Different greens have different nutrients, and, generally speaking, a leaf has more nutrients the darker it is in color. We''ve got recipe ideas for you, too, so','foods/diffrentgreens.jpg','Diffrent Greens'),
	 (40,2,8,'Find mombar stock IMAGE_PATHs in HD and millions of other royalty-free stock photos, illustrations and vectors in the Shutterstock collection.','foods/mombar.jpg','Mombar'),
	 (30,2,9,'Preheat grill to medium high heat. Place chicken on the grill for 7-8 minutes. Flip over and cook an additional 7-8 minutes or until no pink remains','foods/grilledchicken.jpg','Grilled Chicken'),
	 (70,2,10,'Kofta is a family of meatball or meatloaf dishes found in the Indian subcontinent, South Caucasian, Middle Eastern, Balkan, and Central Asian cuisines.','foods/kofta.jpg','Kofta');
