	 (5,6,39,'Un dأ©ca is simply a decaffeinated version of espresso. As you can see, there are far less coffee variations in France than in Italy. I personally find French coffee much more bitter than Italian coffee.','hot-drinks/frenchcoffee.jpg','French Coffee'),
